raRPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" i="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="002060"/></a:solidFill></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" dirty="0"><a:highlight><a:srgbClr val="FFFF00"/></a:highlight></a:rPr><a:t>Action  1</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" dirty="0"/><a:t>) Server will send that player this message automatically  “Landing player (Name ----) wants to consult with you”. Click screen to get question, no Boffins allowed to help.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" dirty="0"><a:highlight><a:srgbClr val="FFFF00"/></a:highlight></a:rPr><a:t>Action 2a) </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" dirty="0"/><a:t>Then they  will get sponsored question on screen for 20 seconds, which will be read only to them. All other players will be presented with sponsor’s advert, whilst Landing  players move is active. In this time other players can choose to select to check own Game Account Folder contents.</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" dirty="0"><a:highlight><a:srgbClr val="FFFF00"/></a:highlight></a:rPr><a:t> </a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" dirty="0"><a:highlight><a:srgbClr val="FFFF00"/></a:highlight></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" dirty="0"><a:highlight><a:srgbClr val="FFFF00"/></a:highlight></a:rPr><a:t>Action 2b</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" dirty="0"/><a:t>) On clicking screen that colour banded Company Square Dice will role and display value of question for player of basic 10% value as reward FEE for selecting correct answer to question. </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" dirty="0"><a:highlight><a:srgbClr val="FFFF00"/></a:highlight></a:rPr><a:t>Action 2 c) </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" dirty="0"/><a:t>Reward that would have been displayed as reward in (Action 2) is reduced too 10% </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400"/><a:t>of basic value </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" dirty="0"/><a:t>only.</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr kumimoji="0" lang="en-GB" sz="1400" b="0" i="0" u="none" strike="noStrike" kern="1200" cap="none" spc="0" normalizeH="0" baseline="0" noProof="0" dirty="0"><a:ln><a:noFill/></a:ln><a:solidFill><a:prstClr val="black"/></a:solidFill><a:effectLst/><a:uLnTx/><a:uFillTx/><a:latin typeface="Aptos" panose="02110004020202020204"/><a:ea typeface="+mn-ea"/><a:cs typeface="+mn-cs"/></a:rPr><a:t> In this time other players can choose to select to check own Game Account Folder contents.</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr kumimoji="0" lang="en-GB" sz="1400" b="0" i="0" u="none" strike="noStrike" kern="1200" cap="none" spc="0" normalizeH="0" baseline="0" noProof="0" dirty="0"><a:ln><a:noFill/></a:ln><a:solidFill><a:prstClr val="black"/></a:solidFill><a:effectLst/><a:highlight><a:srgbClr val="FFFF00"/></a:highlight><a:uLnTx/><a:uFillTx/><a:latin typeface="Aptos" panose="02110004020202020204"/><a:ea typeface="+mn-ea"/><a:cs typeface="+mn-cs"/></a:rPr><a:t> </a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" dirty="0"><a:highlight><a:srgbClr val="FFFF00"/></a:highlight></a:rPr><a:t>Action 2c </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" dirty="0"/><a:t>If player selects correct answer in allocated time, their Game Account is credited with value of HECUs and move ends and passes to next player in turn.</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" dirty="0"><a:highlight><a:srgbClr val="00FFFF"/></a:highlight></a:rPr><a:t>Action 4a) </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" dirty="0"/><a:t>If player selects wrong answer, message appears “Bad Consultation advise” this appears on all players screens, as warning of poor knowledge given.  Landing player is compensated with 3 x Consultation FEE value of HECUs  which is credited to there  Game Account for the poor help given with question answer and their go ends. Play moves to next player in turn.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-GB" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:endParaRPr lang="en-GB" sz="1400" i="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="002060"/></a:solidFill></a:endParaRPr></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree><p:extLst><p:ext uri="{BB962C8B-B14F-4D97-AF65-F5344CB8AC3E}"><p14:creationId xmlns:p14="http://schemas.microsoft.com/office/powerpoint/2010/main" val="2519623333"/></p:ext></p:extLst></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>